module capability_discovery_jev

input query
input declaration
input source_digest
input declaration_digest
input catalog_digest
input schema_digest
input correlation_id
input evidence_digest
input first_missing_stage

status AVAILABLE capability evidence is declaration-bound and inspectable
status DEFERRED an explicit external boundary is required before execution
status UNKNOWN capability evidence is incomplete and the first missing stage remains visible

field capability_id
field capability_state
field next_operation
field observation_digest

constraint read_only
constraint no_execution
constraint no_authorization
constraint preserve_unknown
constraint exact_source_declaration_catalog_schema_evidence_tuple
constraint first_missing_stage_is_explicit
